          "guid": "msmz2hs01j9ozlt2",
          "message": {
            "text": "A hook timeout must cancel its own channel entry because the local deny is final. The previous 120-second hook timeout and 15-minute lone-entry TTL created a 13-minute stale window in which cross-project polling could replay already-handled Codex prompts; request-scoped cleanup closes that window without clearing unrelated queued permissions.",
            "markdown": "A hook timeout must cancel its own channel entry because the local deny is final. The previous 120-second hook timeout and 15-minute lone-entry TTL created a 13-minute stale window in which cross-project polling could replay already-handled Codex prompts; request-scoped cleanup closes that window without clearing unrelated queued permissions."
          },
          "locations": [
            {
              "physicalLocation": {
                "artifactLocation": {
                  "uri": "src/aiTools/permissionHook.ts"
                },
                "region": {
                  "startLine": 199,
                  "endLine": 212,
                  "snippet": {
                    "text": "  // HS-9618 — the hook has now made a final local decision, so its injected\n  // request must stop being advertised by the channel. Before this cleanup the\n  // hook denied at 2 minutes but a lone channel entry survived for 15 minutes;\n  // the cross-project popup poll later replayed those abandoned requests in a\n  // rapid burst as soon as another project's active popup closed.\n  //\n  // Best-effort preserves the existing failure policy: timeout still denies even\n  // if the channel disappears between the last poll and this cleanup request.\n  await io.fetchFn(`${base}/permission/cancel`, {\n    method: 'POST',\n    headers: { 'content-type': 'application/json' },\n    body: JSON.stringify({ request_id: requestId }),\n  }).catch(() => null);\n  return emit('deny'); // timed out unanswered → fail-closed"
                  }
                }
              }
            }
          ],
          "properties": {
            "tags": [
              "rationale"
            ],
            "ext-ai-tool-confidence": 0.98
          },
